# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page summarizes the guides that are available in addition to the extensive API documentation of this package.\n"
msgstr "Halaman ini merangkum panduan-panduan yang tersedia selain dokumentasi API paket ini yang sangat lengkap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  These guides might refer to specific Python modules when explaining core concepts. Unless otherwise stated, the C API provides matching functionality, although it is not structured into modules. However, the function names correspond naturally and should be easy to navigate.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Catatan\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Panduan-panduan ini mungkin merujuk ke modul Python tertentu saat menjelaskan konsep inti. Kecuali dinyatakan lain, C API menyediakan fungsionalitas yang setara, meskipun tidak distrukturkan dalam modul. Namun, nama fungsinya berkesesuaian secara alami dan mudah dinavigasi.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

